    <summary>Local excel password recovery for your own .xlsx and .xls files: remove sheet and workbook locks, or search for a forgotten open password with a dictionary and rules.</summary>
    <description>Excel Password Recovery Software is a commercial Windows utility and local excel password remover for workbooks you own. It handles both locks people forget: the password on a sheet or workbook structure, and the password that must be typed to open a file. For a group of office PCs it suits finance and reporting teams, where staff regularly lose the password to their own old spreadsheets.

![Excel Password Recovery screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/xpr/xpr-v1-saved.png)

## Before you install

Installing this package gives you the free trial of a commercial program, and full use needs a paid license. The installer carries the search engine and a starter word list, so the first run needs no extra download.

## How to use Excel Password Recovery Software

1. Start the program and add files with Add Files, or load a whole directory through Add Folder.
2. Choose where the unlocked copies should go.
3. Press Start and watch the progress bar. Start becomes Stop while the job is running.
4. Open the result window. It lists the recovered password, masked after the first character in the trial, and its length.
5. Use Show password or Unlock document once a license is active.

Trial note: the free trial runs the full job and shows the result, yet the password stays masked and the unlocked workbook is not saved. A license removes both limits.

![Excel Password Recovery screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/xpr/xpr-v1-empty.png)

## Who needs to unprotect Excel sheet locks

- Teams that keep many reports in Excel and need to unprotect excel sheet locks that a former colleague used to protect the file.
- Admins who answer tickets from people who need to recover excel password access to a workbook they forgot.
- Offices that want an excel password remover keeping every file inside the company network.

## How to recover Excel password locks of different kinds

Sheet protection, like protection on the workbook structure, is stored as a setting, so the program removes it without guessing anything. A workbook that needs a password to open is different. For it the program tries dictionary words with mutation rules, and a graphics card makes this much faster. Current Excel files, such as an xlsx file, are deliberately slow to test, around ten thousand passwords per second on a mid-range card. Names, words and short number endings are within reach. A long random password is not, and the program does not claim to recover it.

![Excel Password Recovery screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/xpr/xpr-v1-found.png)

## Excel password remover: trial and license

What Chocolatey delivers is the trial build. To reveal the full password and save the unlocked file you need a license from SoftOrbits. The site offers lifetime, one-year and business terms, the last for several machines. Details are on the [Excel Password Recovery](https://www.softorbits.net/excel-password-recovery/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

## FAQ

### How can I unprotect an Excel sheet without a password?

Add the workbook and press Start. Protection on a sheet is cleared directly, while an open password has to be found first. Saving the result needs a license.

### How to recover Excel password for a file you cannot open?

Run the search on the file and wait for the result window. It shows the length of the recovered password and its first character, and a license shows the rest so you can type it into Excel.

### How to unprotect a password?

Excel has no step that undoes a lost password, so you work on the lock it guards. Run this excel password recovery program on the sheet or workbook, and it removes that protection on your PC while your file is only read.
